### ==============================================================================
### FASE 4: REST API CLIENT (ANGGARAN INVESTASI / CAPEX & LAPTOP/PC LINTAS UNIT)
### Format: VS Code REST Client
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Ambil Token CSRF
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf
Content-Type: application/json

###
@csrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 2. Login sebagai PIC Unit 1 (Rina)
# @name loginPIC
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Ambil Master Kategori Investasi & Prioritas
GET {{baseUrl}}/investment-categories
Content-Type: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/priorities
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Buat / Dapatkan Dokumen Anggaran Investasi (Type: INVESTASI)
# @name createInvestDoc
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "period_id": 1,
  "unit_id": 1,
  "type": "INVESTASI"
}

###
@docId = {{createInvestDoc.response.body.doc_id}}

### 5. Tambah Baris Investasi Baru (BR-01, BR-15, BR-16)
# @name createInvestLine
POST {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/{{docId}}/investment-lines
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "USG 4D High Definition HD-Live",
  "specification": "Probe konveks 3.5MHz, Layar OLED 21 inch, Doppler Color",
  "priority_id": 1,
  "qty": 1,
  "unit_price": 185000000,
  "plan_month": 4,
  "strategy_objective": "Peningkatan akurasi diagnostik fetal maternal klinik spesialis",
  "counter_measure": "Kenaikan utilisasi pemeriksaan USG 25%",
  "program_kerja": "Modernisasi alat medis instalasi radiologi dan poli kebidanan",
  "strategic_action": "Pengadaan unit baru dan sertifikasi teknisi operator"
}

###
@lineId = {{createInvestLine.response.body.data.id}}

### 6. Ambil Daftar Baris Investasi & Rekapitulasi Dokumen
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/{{docId}}/investment-lines
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Ambil Saran Teks yang Pernah Dipakai Unit Ini (Autocomplete / Suggestion Chips)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/{{docId}}/investment-lines/suggestions?field=program_kerja
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Ambil 4 Isian Teks dari Baris Investasi Sebelumnya (Fitur Salin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budget-docs/{{docId}}/investment-lines/last-text
Content-Type: application/json

### 9. Perbarui Baris Investasi (Optimistic Locking dengan Version)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines/{{lineId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "USG 4D High Definition HD-Live v2",
  "specification": "Probe konveks 3.5MHz, Layar OLED 24 inch, Doppler Color Pro",
  "priority_id": 1,
  "qty": 1,
  "unit_price": 190000000,
  "plan_month": 5,
  "strategy_objective": "Peningkatan akurasi diagnostik fetal maternal klinik spesialis",
  "counter_measure": "Kenaikan utilisasi pemeriksaan USG 30%",
  "program_kerja": "Modernisasi alat medis instalasi radiologi dan poli kebidanan",
  "strategic_action": "Pengadaan unit baru dan sertifikasi teknisi operator",
  "version": 1
}

### 10. PIC Ditolak saat Mengakses Konsolidasi Laptop & PC Lintas Unit (403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines?is_laptop_pc=true
Content-Type: application/json

### 11. Login sebagai Akuntansi (Dya Putri)
# @name loginAkuntansi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "dya@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 12. Akuntansi Mengakses Pengadaan Laptop & PC Lintas Unit (Mockup 15-laptop-pc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines?is_laptop_pc=true&period_id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Hapus Baris Investasi (Sebagai PIC atau Akuntansi)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/investment-lines/{{lineId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
